  "name": "homeo-dataset",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\ud83c\udf77 FineWeb\n\t\n\n\n    \n\n\n\n15 trillion tokens of the finest data the \ud83c\udf10 web has to offer\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tWhat is it?\n\t\n\nThe \ud83c\udf77 FineWeb dataset consists of more than 15T tokens of cleaned and deduplicated english web data from CommonCrawl. The data processing pipeline is optimized for LLM performance and ran on the \ud83c\udfed datatrove library, our large scale data processing library. \n\ud83c\udf77 FineWeb was originally meant to be a fully open replication of \ud83e\udd85 RefinedWeb, with a release of the full dataset under\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/akhilhsingh/homeo-dataset.",
